\]

Optional: include the error term (clarifies “noise” vs. signal)

\[
\color{var(--accent)}{Y}
\;=\;
\color{var(--muted)}{a}
\;+\;
\sum_{j=1}^{p} \color{var(--bp)}{b_j X_j}
\;+\;
\varepsilon
\]


() captures what the predictors miss (random error + other influences).
Leave it off for quick intuition; add it when discussing residuals and diagnostics.
